        "TextSection": {
            "TextSectionType": "Definition",
            "Contents": "A rare infantile epilepsy syndrome characterized by an infantile-onset of sudden frequent and generalized myoclonic seizures that occur in neurologically and developmentally normal patients and later resolve during childhood with a generally favorable outcome."
        },
